Author: 仓鼠王 <yjianbin419@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Sep 23 03:53:54 2026 +0800

    test(review): the end-to-end arm for ORD-0232 refuses to run until its emitter is on this tip
    
    plans.candidate_rejected comes from a96fabf, which sits on agent/canary-ord198-20260922 and is not
    an ancestor of the integration line, so a real chain here answers with zero events -- and "zero
    events" is indistinguishable from "the renderer works".  The arm ships as a runnable command that
    exits 7 with the named reason instead of joining the shared red baseline or passing vacuously.

